<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse to open Internet site next month.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse to open Internet site next month.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels bourse said on Wednesday it would open a site on the Internet from February 12.</p>
<p>The site, http://www.bourse.be, will contain price quotations with only a 15 minute delay from real time as well as general information about the bourse.</p>
<p>It will also contain a facility for firms to post press statements as well as for users to create their own pages through which to monitor their share portfolios and to post and receive messages.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
